{"key":"enterprise/T1087","id":"T1087","name":"Account Discovery","domain":"enterprise","level":"technique","parent_id":null,"tactics":["discovery"],"platforms":["ESXi","IaaS","Identity Provider","Linux","macOS","Office Suite","SaaS","Windows"],"environments":["cloud","cloud-hosted-endpoint","identity","onprem","saas","virtualization"],"environment_basis":"project_taxonomy_from_upstream_platforms","summary":"Adversaries may attempt to get a listing of valid accounts, usernames, or email addresses on a system or within a compromised environment. This information can help adversaries determine which accounts exist, which can aid in follow-on behavior such as brute-forcing, spear-phishing attacks, or account takeovers (e.g., Valid Accounts). Adversaries may use several methods to enumerate accounts, including abuse of existing tools, built-in commands,…","source_url":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1087","source_stix_id":"attack-pattern--72b74d71-8169-42aa-92e0-e7b04b9f5a08","source_modified":"2026-05-12T15:12:00.641Z","source_object_version":"2.6","telemetry":{"status":"mapped","components":[{"id":"DC0083","name":"Cloud Service Enumeration","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/datacomponents/DC0083","stix_id":"x-mitre-data-component--8c826308-2760-492f-9e36-4f0f7e23bcac","page":"telemetry/DC0083/"},{"id":"DC0064","name":"Command Execution","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/datacomponents/DC0064","stix_id":"x-mitre-data-component--685f917a-e95e-4ba0-ade1-c7d354dae6e0","page":"telemetry/DC0064/"},{"id":"DC0055","name":"File Access","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/datacomponents/DC0055","stix_id":"x-mitre-data-component--235b7491-2d2b-4617-9a52-3c0783680f71","page":"telemetry/DC0055/"},{"id":"DC0099","name":"Group Enumeration","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/datacomponents/DC0099","stix_id":"x-mitre-data-component--8e44412e-3238-4d64-8878-4f11e27784fe","page":"telemetry/DC0099/"},{"id":"DC0032","name":"Process Creation","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/datacomponents/DC003